      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A non-trifling frequency (3,3 p. 100) of neurologic complications is observed after surgery under E.C.C. The part of some factors has been analysed and discussed, especially those played by the type of the system used, quality of the E.C.C., and the patients' conditions. Many problems are still unresolved. The actual gravity of observed troubles must bring a better harshness in preventive treatment, and to a more adjusted treatment when these troubles are noted."},
